---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdSlot from '../components/AdSlot.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL === '/' ? '' : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | CalcGlobal" 
  description="Privacy Policy for CalcGlobal."
>
  <div class="bg-slate-800 text-white pt-14 pb-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <nav class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
        <a href={`${base}/`} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-white font-medium">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2 text-base">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-slate">
    <p>At CalcGlobal, we prioritize your privacy. We do not collect, store, or share your personal financial data. All calculations are performed entirely in your browser.</p>
    
    <h3>1. Data Collection</h3>
    <p>We do not collect personal data. We use basic analytics (like Google Analytics) to measure website traffic and performance. These tools may use cookies.</p>
    
    <h3>2. Cookies and Advertising</h3>
    <p>We use cookies to personalize content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyze our traffic. We also share information about your use of our site with our advertising and analytics partners.</p>
    
    <h4>Google AdSense & Third-Party Vendors</h4>
    <p>This website uses Google AdSense, a web advertising service of Google LLC. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on our site.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
      <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h3>3. Affiliate Links</h3>
    <p>Some of the links on our site are affiliate links. This means that, at zero cost to you, we will earn an affiliate commission if you click through the link and finalize a purchase or signup.</p>

    <AdSlot variant="rectangle" pageIntent="low" className="my-8 not-prose" />
  </div>
</Layout>
